  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">V&#xe4;rldsbankens fond f&#xf6;r handelsstrategin</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank MDTF-TD2 Multi Donor Trust Fund for</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MDTF-TD2 st&#xf6;der genomf&#xf6;randet av V&#xe4;rldsbankens (VB) handelsrelaterade arbete, som &#xe4;r inriktat p&#xe5; att hj&#xe4;lpa utvecklingsl&#xe4;nderna att dra     nytta av integration i den globala ekonomin. Fondens aktiviteter      grundar sig p&#xe5; VB handelsstrategi och syftar till att integrera       handel i bankens arbete. Fonden ger samarbetsl&#xe4;nderna                 efterfr&#xe5;ge-baserat st&#xf6;d, samt utf&#xf6;r analys, forskning och</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MDTF-TD2 supports the implementation of the World Bank&apos;s (WB)         trade-related work, which focuses on helping developing countries to  benefit from the integration in the global economy. The Fund&apos;s        activities are based on the WB Trade Strategy and aims to mainstream  trade in the Bank&apos;s work. The fund provides partner countries         demand-based support, and performs analysis, research and advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention&apos;s overall objective is to fully mainstream trade in the World Bank&apos;s country work so that by the time it closes trade activities are integrated seamlessly into country programs, as reflected by Country Assistance Strategies, Country Economic Memorandums and Poverty Reduction Support Credits, and fully funded through the Bank&apos;s own resources.</narrative>
  </description>
